# Features

- A feature may only be imported through its `index.ts` barrel — never its
  internals (ESLint-enforced).
- Data access goes through TanStack Query (in `hooks/`), not ad-hoc `fetch` in
  components.

Detail: [apps/dashboard/docs/feature-conventions.md](../../apps/dashboard/docs/feature-conventions.md).
